# Source material for scripts/optimize-assets.py and the resume pipeline.
# Deliberately untracked: ~4.1MB of large binaries whose optimised outputs are
# already committed and served from public/ (favicon.png, apple-touch-icon.png,
# og/og-home.jpg, Derren_Winata_Resume.pdf). The only file a script reads back
# is favicon-source.png, and that path already falls back to public/favicon.png
# when the pristine copy is absent — so a fresh clone still builds cleanly.
assets/
